<title>USA: U.S. BARLEY WEEKLY EXPORT SALES HIGHLIGHTS--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. BARLEY WEEKLY EXPORT SALES HIGHLIGHTS--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales activity of 500 MT were the result of increases for Saudi Arabia (25,500 MT, including new sales of 500 MT and changes of 25,000 MT from unknown destinations).</p>
<p>Exports of 25,500 MT--all to Saudi Arabia--were 51 percent below the 4-week average.</p>
</text>
